WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.810
Melbourne has been the most livable

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:09.830
city in the world for
the past seven years.

00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:13.713
But this year it lost
the top spot to Vienna.

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:16.872
Home to Strauss and
Schubert and famous for its

00:00:16.872 --> 00:00:21.620
coffee houses, Vienna scored
an almost perfect 99.1%.

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:29.376
But what makes a city livable?

00:00:29.376 --> 00:00:33.750
The Economist intelligence
unit has been analyzing this.

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:38.270
It has ranked 140 cities
according to stability,

00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:40.857
education, healthcare, infrastructure,

00:00:40.857 --> 00:00:43.013
and culture and environment.

00:00:43.866 --> 00:00:47.254
Most livable cities tend
to be mid sized in wealthy

00:00:47.254 --> 00:00:50.693
countries and with low
population densities.

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:57.520
Copenhagen is the only other
European city in the top 10.

00:00:57.520 --> 00:01:01.323
Australia and Canada each have
three cities and Japan two.

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:05.360
Western Europe and North America are

00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:07.870
the most livable regions in the world.

00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:10.690
The Middle East and Africa the least.

00:01:10.690 --> 00:01:13.160
While asia and Australasia
are home to some

00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:16.273
of the world's most livable
and unlivable cities.

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:23.260
Many factors impact how livable a city

00:01:23.260 --> 00:01:25.770
is like natural disasters.

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:27.946
Hurricanes Irma and Maria destroyed much

00:01:27.946 --> 00:01:30.100
of Puerto Rico this year.

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:32.180
The capital San Juan fell further

00:01:32.180 --> 00:01:33.983
in rank than any other city.

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:38.462
The ending of Ivory Coast's
13 year UN peacekeeping

00:01:38.462 --> 00:01:41.625
mission demonstrated a
step toward stability

00:01:41.625 --> 00:01:44.513
and a steady increase in its livability.

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:48.950
The rankings of cities
like Damascus, Lagos,

00:01:48.950 --> 00:01:52.210
Karachi, and Tripoli
show the extent to which

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:54.873
conflict contributes to
low livability scores.

00:01:56.466 --> 00:01:59.831
And Caracas, the least
livable city in Latin America,

00:01:59.831 --> 00:02:03.510
is only set to get worse
owing to the deepening

00:02:03.510 --> 00:02:07.493
economic crisis and rising
authoritarianism in Venezuela.

00:02:08.680 --> 00:02:11.909
Mega cities like London,
Paris, and New York have high

00:02:11.909 --> 00:02:15.635
levels of crime, congestion,
and public transport problems

00:02:15.635 --> 00:02:18.253
which keep them out of the top spots.

00:02:19.940 --> 00:02:22.230
This year the world overall has become

00:02:22.230 --> 00:02:23.894
a better place to live.

00:02:23.894 --> 00:02:27.116
This is because of the
decrease in terrorism threats,

00:02:27.116 --> 00:02:29.860
specifically in western Europe.

00:02:29.860 --> 00:02:32.000
Vienna's increased stability is what has

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:33.583
given it the edge this year.

